Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on July 31, 2024.
Article 2 Omitted.
Article 3 (Relationship to other statutes or regulations)
A citation of the previous Enforcement Decree of the Road Traffic Act or any provision thereof by any other statute or regulation in force as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed a citation of this Decree or the corresponding provision hereof in lieu of the previous Enforcement Decree of the Road Traffic Act or the provision thereof, if such corresponding provision exists herein.

